|lead='''Obi-Wan's Lightsaber''' is a [[Light]] [[Weapon]] released as a very-rare foil in [[Reflections]] in January 2000.<ref name="checklist">[https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/swccgcardlist4.0.pdf Complete Card List v4.0], pp. 28–32 (collecting compilation). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261009184033/https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/swccgcardlist4.0.pdf Internet Archive].</ref><ref name="encyc">[https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/Star_Wars_CCG_Collecting_Encyclopedia_3.2.pdf SWCCG Collecting Encyclopedia 3.2], Reflections product entry (collecting reference). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261008192828/https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/Star_Wars_CCG_Collecting_Encyclopedia_3.2.pdf Internet Archive].</ref> It is a foil printing of the [[Premiere]] card.<ref name="foil-face">[[:File:Reflections-Foil-L-Obi-Wan-s-Lightsaber-PSA-photo-138963775-original.jpg|Original printed Reflections foil face]], Robert John.</ref>
|lore=“An elegant weapon for a more civilized time.” Miniaturized power cell. Uses rare crystals to focus the lightblade. This lightsaber was personally built by Obi-Wan.<ref name="foil-face" />
|game_text=Deploy on Obi-Wan. May add 1 to Force drain where present. May target a character or creature for free. Draw two destiny. Target hit, and its forfeit = 0, if total destiny &gt; defense value.<ref name="foil-face" />
